# Local dev loop — kept out of the published repo.
# The dev loader @requires the userscript from a local HTTP server (Firefox
# extensions cannot read file:// URLs), and the fixtures drive the panel
# against the live API. None of it is needed to run the released userscript,
# which is self-contained.
claude-overview.dev.user.js
dev-server.mjs
test/
